      "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"http://earthporm.com/girl-gets-gifts-from-crows/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" title=\"01:36AM - 10 March 2015\">Earth Porm – 10 Mar 15</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/358;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3b213a85bc96be671ea499f07260123371b93709_2_690x358.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"358\" srcset=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3b213a85bc96be671ea499f07260123371b93709_2_690x358.jpeg, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3b213a85bc96be671ea499f07260123371b93709.jpeg 1.5x, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3b213a85bc96be671ea499f07260123371b93709.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3b213a85bc96be671ea499f07260123371b93709_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"http://earthporm.com/girl-gets-gifts-from-crows/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">8-Year-Old Girl Gets Gifts From Crows She's Been Feeding For 4 Years</a></h3>\n\n<p>8-year-old never expected anything in return for feeding the birds, now girl gets gifts from crows.</p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"label1\">Est. reading time: 4 minutes</span>\n    </p>\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>She’s also getting sued by her neighbors.</p>",
